!!! 07-contracts.matrix
!!! Contracts (Ny traits), implementations, generic bounds and associated
!!! functions.
!!!
!!! Implementations use static dispatch. There are no dynamic contract objects
!!! in Matrix, because NIL does not execute them.

book tour.contracts

!!! A contract declares signatures with no bodies. Default method bodies are
!!! rejected in Ny and therefore have no Matrix spelling.
read everything from ny.lang.core

Reading of type T begin contract
    read-level returns T
    replace receives replacement as T on mutable receiver returns nothing
end contract

Fingerprint begin contract
    fingerprint returns number
end contract

Meter begin record
    field level as number
end record

!!! An implementation of a named contract must supply every required
!!! signature, after substituting the contract arguments. Numeric assignment
!!! conversions do not make different signatures equivalent: "integer" is not
!!! an implementation of a "long" result.
Meter provides Reading of number begin implementation

    read-level returns number begin paragraph
        give my level
    end paragraph

    replace receives replacement as number on mutable receiver returns nothing begin paragraph
        set my level to replacement
    end paragraph

    !!! An extra concrete helper is allowed and does not become a contract
    !!! requirement.
    doubled returns number begin paragraph
        give my level times 2
    end paragraph
end implementation

Meter provides Fingerprint begin implementation
    fingerprint returns number begin paragraph
        give my level bitwise xor 255
    end paragraph
end implementation

!!! An inherent implementation block, with no contract named.
Counter begin record
    field level as number
end record

Counter begin implementation
    increment returns number begin paragraph
        give my level plus 1
    end paragraph
end implementation

!!! A generic implementation constrained by a bound. The bound restricts which
!!! concrete types may instantiate the generic code; it does not relax the
!!! native layout restrictions, which still apply independently.
Envelope of type T begin record
    field item as T
end record

Envelope of type T meeting Fingerprint begin implementation
    item_fingerprint returns number begin paragraph
        give my item.fingerprint with nothing
    end paragraph
end implementation

!!! An associated function has no receiver and can be called through a bounded
!!! type parameter. Two different bounds exposing the same associated function
!!! are ambiguous and are rejected rather than resolved by declaration order.
build_default of type T meeting Default returns T begin paragraph
    give T.default with nothing
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    variable gauge is build Meter with level being 20

    say gauge.read-level with nothing
    evaluate gauge.replace with replacement being 42
    say gauge.read-level with nothing
    say gauge.doubled with nothing
    say gauge.fingerprint with nothing

    value tally is build Counter with level being 41
    say tally.increment with nothing

    value wrapped is build Envelope of Meter with item being gauge
    say wrapped.item_fingerprint with nothing

    give 0
end paragraph
